            <ArticleTitle>Untreated Isolated Torsion of the Epididymis in an Adolescent.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.eucr.2015.11.006</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Although torsion of epididymis is extremely rare, it should be kept in mind in the differential diagnosis of acute scrotal pain in adolescents. We report here a very rare cause of acute scrotum: torsion of the epididymis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
